msgid "构建入口、目标依赖与接入边界"
msgstr "Build entry points, target dependencies and onboarding boundaries"

msgid "本页维护应用、SoC 和组件接入同一生产目标图的合同，以及本轮 B1–B9 的 44 项任务。 重构基线为 `bfde3b9a`。下述接口是本轮实施合同；源码实现、实际验证和物理 HIL 分别记录。 旧 BR 计划与计时见[固定前序源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/bfde3b9ace6cbb3f3b7344dcd779532b5ef4ba40/docs/design/build-architecture.md)，不继承为本轮资格。"
msgstr "This page maintains the contract for applications, SoCs and components to use one production target graph, together with the 44 tasks in B1–B9. The refactoring baseline is `bfde3b9a`. The interfaces below are this increment's implementation contract; source implementation, actual verification and physical HIL are recorded separately. The old BR plan and timings remain in the [fixed previous source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/bfde3b9ace6cbb3f3b7344dcd779532b5ef4ba40/docs/design/build-architecture.md), without qualifying this increment."

msgid "应用入口"
msgstr "Application entry points"

msgid "Preset 在 `project()` 前选择 Ninja、工具链、SDK 和独立构建目录。工具链定位编译器与 binutils；平台随后验证并应用 CPU、FPU 和 ABI，不能在启用语言后更换编译器。每个构建 目录只有一个装配和工具链；同装配可以创建多个镜像，不同装配使用独立目录。"
msgstr "Before `project()`, the preset selects Ninja, the toolchain, SDK and a separate build directory. The toolchain locates compilers and binutils; the platform then validates and applies CPU, FPU and ABI requirements without changing compilers after language initialization. Each build directory has one assembly and toolchain. Several images can share that assembly; different assemblies use separate directories."

msgid "`find_package()` 定位并验证 SDK、检查版本和提供 API，不解析装配、不生成绑定、不创建 生产目标。`nexus_add_platform()` 显式创建唯一平台，第二次创建明确拒绝。独立 CPU Runtime 使用 `nexus_add_runtime(ASSEMBLY ...)`，应用负责启动与板级集成；它不能与 Platform 在同一构建图中混用。重复发现同一 SDK 不重复装配，也不跳过实际身份检查。"
msgstr "`find_package()` locates and verifies the SDK, checks its version and provides APIs without resolving an assembly, generating bindings or creating production targets. `nexus_add_platform()` explicitly creates the only platform and rejects a second creation. Independent CPU Runtime uses `nexus_add_runtime(ASSEMBLY ...)`; applications own startup and board integration, and cannot mix it with Platform in the same build graph. Repeated discovery of the same SDK neither repeats assembly nor skips actual identity checks."

msgid "源码 checkout 的 `Nexus_DIR` 指向其 `cmake/`，安装 SDK 指向 prefix 下的 `lib/cmake/Nexus/`。两者使用同一公共 API 和生产图。应用不需要修改平台测试开关， 也不需要编写 `add_subdirectory` 与 `find_package` 分支。应用模块继续使用原生 `add_library()` 和 `target_link_libraries()`；`Nexus::ABI` 提供必要二进制约定， `Nexus::OS` 表示已选后端，应用不拼接内部目标名称。"
msgstr "For a source checkout, `Nexus_DIR` points to its `cmake/`; for an installed SDK, it points to `lib/cmake/Nexus/` under the prefix. Both use the same public APIs and production graph. Applications do not override platform test switches or write `add_subdirectory` versus `find_package` branches. Application modules keep native `add_library()` and `target_link_libraries()`. `Nexus::ABI` provides binary requirements, and `Nexus::OS` denotes the selected backend; applications do not construct internal target names."

msgid "配置、目标与镜像"
msgstr "Configuration, targets and images"

msgid "![TOML、同一输入快照、静态连接和唯一 CMake 图](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"
msgstr "![TOML, one input snapshot, static connections and the sole CMake graph](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"

msgid "TOML、同一输入快照、静态连接和唯一 CMake 图"
msgstr "TOML, one input snapshot, static connections and the sole CMake graph"

msgid "箭头表示构建期输入和生成关系，不表示运行调用或物理资格。解析器从 TOML、Board 和 SoC 事实构造不可变 typed IR，原子生成静态 C、factory、内存计划和选择投影。CMake 决定翻译单元和依赖，Ninja 执行目标图；配置工具不维护第二份 C 源码列表。"
msgstr "Arrows represent build-time inputs and generation, not runtime calls or physical qualification. The resolver constructs immutable typed IR from TOML, Board and SoC facts, then atomically generates static C, factories, the memory plan and selection projections. CMake owns translation units and dependencies, and Ninja executes the graph. Configuration tools maintain no second C source list."

msgid "位置"
msgstr "Location"

msgid "拥有的责任"
msgstr "Owned responsibility"

msgid "根 `CMakeLists.txt`"
msgstr "Root `CMakeLists.txt`"

msgid "平台开发工程、维护默认值、显式测试与 workload"
msgstr "Platform development project, maintenance defaults, explicit tests and workload"

msgid "`cmake/Nexus.cmake`"
msgstr "`cmake/Nexus.cmake`"

msgid "公共 API，加载时不创建装配"
msgstr "Public APIs; loading creates no assembly"

msgid "`cmake/platform/`"
msgstr "`cmake/platform/`"

msgid "唯一生产图、私有装配上下文、目标策略、Provider 合同和镜像"
msgstr "Sole production graph, private assembly context, target policy, Provider contract and images"

msgid "`cmake/package/`"
msgstr "`cmake/package/`"

msgid "安装包、字节身份、导出和真实消费验证"
msgstr "Installed package, byte identity, export and real consumer verification"

msgid "`cmake/toolchains/`"
msgstr "`cmake/toolchains/`"

msgid "编译器、binutils 与交叉编译环境"
msgstr "Compilers, binutils and cross-compilation environment"

msgid "`soc/<vendor>/<family>/`"
msgstr "`soc/<vendor>/<family>/`"

msgid "芯片事实、驱动、System、私有 SDK 和启动要求"
msgstr "Device facts, drivers, System, private SDK and startup requirements"

msgid "`components/`"
msgstr "`components/`"

msgid "叶组件源码及公开／私有依赖"
msgstr "Leaf component sources and public/private dependencies"

msgid "`tools/configure/`"
msgstr "`tools/configure/`"

msgid "严格解析、资源校验、不可变 IR 与静态连接"
msgstr "Strict parsing, resource validation, immutable IR and static connections"

msgid "生产图在私有目录作用域装配。应用的全局 flags、输出目录、测试开关和缓存配置由应用 管理。装配元数据、编译使用要求和 Provider 私有实现分别传递，不将完整选择集合变成 所有消费者的公共宏。"
msgstr "The production graph is assembled in a private directory scope. Applications own their global flags, output directories, test switches and cache configuration. Assembly metadata, compilation usage requirements and private Provider implementation are passed separately; the full selection set does not become public macros for every consumer."

msgid "Provider、组件和策略"
msgstr "Provider, components and policy"

msgid "Provider target 发布 `NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` 和 `NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET`， 分别表示启动与 System 源绝对路径，以及 Provider 拥有的启动编译要求目标。 `Nexus::Platform` 用 `NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET` 指向实际 Provider。Firmware 读取 固定合同，为每个镜像创建独立 startup OBJECT，并私有链接 startup usage。"
msgstr "The Provider target publishes `NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` and `NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET`: absolute startup/System source paths and the Provider-owned startup compilation requirements target. `Nexus::Platform` references the actual Provider through `NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET`. Firmware reads this fixed contract, creates a separate startup OBJECT for every image and privately links startup usage."

msgid "厂商头、器件宏和 HAL 配置只影响实际消费者。不能无条件共享不同镜像的启动 OBJECT， 也不能通过公共 `INTERFACE_SOURCES` 将厂商源注入应用编译。启动对象、弱符号与 archive 的链接顺序保持明确。F4 保留主要 archive；驱动直接声明 HAL、DMA 和公共 机制，System 自己声明编译要求，不读取兄弟模块先前写入的开关。"
msgstr "Vendor headers, device macros and HAL configuration affect only actual consumers. Startup OBJECTs cannot be shared unconditionally across images, and public `INTERFACE_SOURCES` must not inject vendor sources into application compilation. Startup objects, weak symbols and archives retain explicit link ordering. F4 retains a main archive; drivers declare HAL, DMA and common mechanisms directly. System owns its compilation requirements without reading switches previously written by sibling modules."

msgid "普通组件在叶目录定义目标和依赖，应用直接链接，无需进入 TOML 枚举。确实需要静态 绑定或供应商选择的组件共用一份登记，描述逻辑 ID、CMake 入口和公共 target；配置 合同仍由所属绑定维护，叶目录负责创建。登记不列 C 源码图，公共装配不特判组件名字。轻量目录 保留显式加载；选中重依赖才准备对应供应商。"
msgstr "Ordinary components define targets and dependencies in leaf directories. Applications link them directly without TOML enumeration. Components needing static binding or supplier selection share one catalogue containing logical IDs, CMake entries and public targets. The owning bindings retain configuration contracts, and leaves create implementations. The catalogue contains no C source graph; common assembly does not special-case component names. Lightweight directories remain explicitly loaded, and only selected heavy dependencies prepare their suppliers."

msgid "具体模式在包边界映射为公共 API／机制需求，通用 IO CMake 只消费公共需求，仍由 CMake 选择 `.c`。新增 MCU 复用现有模型时不修改公共调度器；新公共语义或新架构仍须 扩展对应合同。ABI 对互相链接的对象一致；优化、IPO 和 launcher 作用于实际目标； 严格诊断面向自有代码；运行库、`-nostartfiles` 和链接脚本属于最终 image。"
msgstr "At the package boundary, specific modes map to public API/mechanism requirements. Common IO CMake consumes only those public requirements and still selects `.c` files. A new MCU reusing existing models does not change the common dispatcher; new public semantics or architectures still extend their contracts. ABI requirements match across linked objects. Optimization, IPO and launchers apply to actual targets; strict diagnostics apply to owned code. Runtime libraries, `-nostartfiles` and linker scripts belong to the final image."

msgid "增量、失败与身份"
msgstr "Incremental builds, failure and identity"

msgid "普通 C 变更由 Ninja 和编译器依赖触发相关编译。TOML、选中事实和生成器变化重新配置； 内容相同的生成文件保留时间戳。无变化构建不重新 configure、编译或链接。预算或检查器 变化复查已有 ELF；布局变化触发链接。删除 BIN、map 或资源报告后，直接构建原固件 目标仍恢复声明的产物。[固件规则](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake)"
msgstr "Ninja and compiler dependencies rebuild the affected units after an ordinary C change. TOML, selected facts and generator changes reconfigure; unchanged generated contents preserve timestamps. An unchanged build does not reconfigure, compile or link. Budget/checker changes recheck the existing ELF; layout changes relink. Rebuilding the original firmware target restores a deleted BIN, map or resource report. [Firmware rules](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake)"

msgid "配置拒绝或中断使拥有的旧生成结果失效。链接失败或取消撤销旧 BIN 和资源报告。SDK 发现后发生内容变化，后续装配仍要检出。验证只在实际同步边界复用，不持久缓存成功 结论，不以全局布尔值替代字节身份。源码冲突、预期 revision 和开发 fixture 准入保持 严格。ccache 默认关闭，启用后仍保持 SDK 只读；Sanitizer 只用于明确选择的主机范围。"
msgstr "Configuration rejection or interruption invalidates owned old generated outputs. Link failure or cancellation withdraws old BIN and resource reports. Later assembly must detect SDK changes made after discovery. Verification is reused only within an actual synchronous boundary, never as a persistently cached success or a global boolean replacing byte identity. Source conflicts, expected revisions and development-fixture admission remain strict. Ccache defaults to off and keeps the SDK read-only when enabled; Sanitizers apply only to explicitly selected host scopes."

msgid "本轮任务与退出条件"
msgstr "Current tasks and exit conditions"

msgid "本页任务定义实现与验收合同。验收由同一冻结源码的实际门禁、消费者、独立审查和 同步收条判定。源码实现与执行状态分别记录；目标存在和历史结果不能代替新源码的 实际验证。"
msgstr "The tasks on this page define implementation and acceptance contracts. Actual gates, consumers, independent review and synchronization receipts establish acceptance for the same frozen source. Source implementation and execution status are recorded separately; target presence and historical results cannot replace actual verification of a new source revision."

msgid "B1 固定合同"
msgstr "B1 Fix the contracts"

msgid "**B1.1** 固定发现、装配和固件 API，文档、模板与实现一致。"
msgstr "**B1.1** Fix discovery, assembly and firmware APIs so documentation, templates and implementation agree."

msgid "**B1.2** 固定单装配、单工具链、重复调用和来源冲突的拒绝规则。"
msgstr "**B1.2** Fix rejection rules for one assembly, one toolchain, repeated construction and source conflicts."

msgid "**B1.3** 区分元数据、编译要求与私有选择，应用无需读取完整 `NEXUS_*` 集合。"
msgstr "**B1.3** Separate metadata, compilation requirements and private selections; applications need not read the full `NEXUS_*` set."

msgid "**B1.4** 固定 Provider 启动合同与策略传播方向。"
msgstr "**B1.4** Fix the Provider startup contract and direction of policy propagation."

msgid "**B1.5** 固定配置、链接和验证失败后的输出失效责任。"
msgstr "**B1.5** Fix output-invalidation responsibility after configuration, linking or verification failure."

msgid "B2 统一入口"
msgstr "B2 Unify entry points"

msgid "**B2.1** 提取唯一生产图，开发工程和外部工程共同使用。"
msgstr "**B2.1** Extract the sole production graph shared by development and external projects."

msgid "**B2.2** 实现显式 `nexus_add_platform(ASSEMBLY ...)` 并拒绝第二次创建。"
msgstr "**B2.2** Implement explicit `nexus_add_platform(ASSEMBLY ...)` and reject a second creation."

msgid "**B2.3** 包发现不解析 assembly，不创建 generated、Provider、测试或 workload。"
msgstr "**B2.3** Package discovery neither resolves an assembly nor creates generated, Provider, test or workload targets."

msgid "**B2.4** 源码 checkout 与安装 SDK 提供同一公共 API。"
msgstr "**B2.4** Source checkouts and installed SDKs expose the same public APIs."

msgid "**B2.5** Runtime 和 Platform 的公共层装配只维护一份。"
msgstr "**B2.5** Maintain common-layer assembly once for Runtime and Platform."

msgid "**B2.6** 迁移消费者后删除旧隐式装配和安装包代理路径。"
msgstr "**B2.6** Remove implicit assembly and installed-package proxy paths after migrating consumers."

msgid "B3 Provider 启动合同"
msgstr "B3 Provider startup contract"

msgid "**B3.1** 启动源归 Provider target，删除多组父作用域回传。"
msgstr "**B3.1** Startup sources belong to the Provider target; remove multiple parent-scope returns."

msgid "**B3.2** Provider 发布 startup usage，私有 include 和定义由 SoC 拥有。"
msgstr "**B3.2** The Provider publishes startup usage and the SoC owns private includes and defines."

msgid "**B3.3** 按固定合同独立创建每个镜像的 startup OBJECT。"
msgstr "**B3.3** Create independent per-image startup OBJECTs through the fixed contract."

msgid "**B3.4** 删除根入口对启动私有字段的搬运。"
msgstr "**B3.4** Remove copying of private startup fields through the root entry point."

msgid "**B3.5** 已选后端提供 `Nexus::OS`，固件不拼接内部名称。"
msgstr "**B3.5** The selected backend provides `Nexus::OS`; firmware does not construct internal names."

msgid "B4 F4 包内依赖"
msgstr "B4 F4 package dependencies"

msgid "**B4.1** 清点跨驱动共享变量，确定唯一拥有者与消费路径。"
msgstr "**B4.1** Inventory cross-driver variables and identify their sole owner and consumption path."

msgid "**B4.2** 驱动直接声明 SDK、DMA 和辅助实现需求，不修改兄弟模块开关。"
msgstr "**B4.2** Drivers declare SDK, DMA and helper requirements directly without modifying sibling switches."

msgid "**B4.3** System 自身声明启动要求，不依赖驱动文件执行顺序。"
msgstr "**B4.3** System declares startup requirements independently of driver-file execution order."

msgid "**B4.4** HAL 对象只在器件、ABI、配置头和回调一致时复用。"
msgstr "**B4.4** Share HAL objects only when device, ABI, configuration headers and callbacks match."

msgid "B5 组件"
msgstr "B5 Components"

msgid "**B5.1** 区分普通库与需要生成绑定或供应商选择的组件。"
msgstr "**B5.1** Distinguish ordinary libraries from components needing generated bindings or supplier selection."

msgid "**B5.2** 装配组件只维护一份登记，配置校验和 CMake 定位共同消费。"
msgstr "**B5.2** Maintain one assembly-component catalogue shared by configuration validation and CMake lookup."

msgid "**B5.3** 创建行为归叶目录，删除中央组件名称分支。"
msgstr "**B5.3** Leaves own creation; remove central component-name branches."

msgid "**B5.4** 所属目标声明绑定依赖，根入口不引用组件私有目录。"
msgstr "**B5.4** Owning targets declare binding dependencies; the root does not reference component-private directories."

msgid "**B5.5** 未选供应商不初始化、不编译，缺少选中依赖明确失败。"
msgstr "**B5.5** Unselected suppliers are neither initialized nor compiled; missing selected dependencies fail explicitly."

msgid "B6 目标策略"
msgstr "B6 Target policy"

msgid "**B6.1** 提供稳定 `Nexus::ABI` 供应用自建库使用。"
msgstr "**B6.1** Provide stable `Nexus::ABI` usage for application-owned libraries."

msgid "**B6.2** 运行库、启动链接要求和链接脚本只附着最终 image。"
msgstr "**B6.2** Runtime libraries, startup link requirements and linker scripts attach only to the final image."

msgid "**B6.3** 以实际命令验证优化、IPO 和 launcher 生效。"
msgstr "**B6.3** Verify optimization, IPO and launchers through actual commands."

msgid "**B6.4** 自有严格诊断与厂商编译范围隔离。"
msgstr "**B6.4** Isolate owned strict diagnostics from vendor compilation scopes."

msgid "**B6.5** ccache 和 Sanitizer 仅影响显式目标，不写入安装 SDK。"
msgstr "**B6.5** Ccache and Sanitizers affect only explicit targets without writing into the installed SDK."

msgid "B7 公共 IO 需求"
msgstr "B7 Public IO requirements"

msgid "**B7.1** 清点通用 IO 中的模式判断并确定所属包边界。"
msgstr "**B7.1** Inventory mode checks in common IO and establish their owning package boundary."

msgid "**B7.2** 在已有 typed IR／投影中表达公共需求，不生成源码图。"
msgstr "**B7.2** Express public requirements in existing typed IR/projections without generating a source graph."

msgid "**B7.3** 通用 IO 按公共需求连接目标，具体模式规则由包拥有。"
msgstr "**B7.3** Common IO connects targets by public requirements; packages own specific mode rules."

msgid "**B7.4** 验证空选择、多控制器、多模式和去重，保持未选代码裁剪。"
msgstr "**B7.4** Verify empty selections, multiple controllers/modes and deduplication while retaining unselected-code pruning."

msgid "B8 应用与文档"
msgstr "B8 Applications and documentation"

msgid "**B8.1** 迁移 starter 和示例，删除开发开关及重复导入分支。"
msgstr "**B8.1** Migrate starters and examples; remove development switches and duplicate import branches."

msgid "**B8.2** Preset 负责工具链、SDK 和构建目录，TOML 保持硬件意图权威。"
msgstr "**B8.2** Presets own toolchains, SDK location and build directories; TOML remains authoritative for hardware intent."

msgid "**B8.3** 更新架构、SDK、接入说明、框图和完整中英文译文。"
msgstr "**B8.3** Update architecture, SDK and onboarding guides, diagrams and complete English/Chinese translations."

msgid "**B8.4** 删除无消费者旧入口及过时测试，保留等价故障覆盖。"
msgstr "**B8.4** Remove unused old entry points and obsolete tests while retaining equivalent failure coverage."

msgid "B9 验证与交付"
msgstr "B9 Verification and delivery"

msgid "**B9.1** 真实消费者验证发现无装配副作用、重复创建和来源冲突。"
msgstr "**B9.1** Real consumers verify discovery without assembly side effects, duplicate creation and source conflicts."

msgid "**B9.2** 验证 Provider、启动对象、策略和应用可见性隔离。"
msgstr "**B9.2** Verify isolation of Providers, startup objects, policy and application visibility."

msgid "**B9.3** 验证源码、事实、预算、缺失产物、失败和取消的增量行为。"
msgstr "**B9.3** Verify incremental behavior for sources, facts, budgets, missing outputs, failures and cancellation."

msgid "**B9.4** 执行源码、搬迁 SDK、只读 SDK、Runtime、F4 及 C／C++ 消费路径。"
msgstr "**B9.4** Execute source, relocated SDK, read-only SDK, Runtime, F4 and C/C++ consumer paths."

msgid "**B9.5** 有限对照 configure、编译、链接和验证耗时，解释资源与身份差异。"
msgstr "**B9.5** Compare bounded configure, compile, link and validation samples; explain resource and identity differences."

msgid "**B9.6** 最终源码冻结后完成门禁、独立审查、两仓来源对齐和 GitHub 同步。"
msgstr "**B9.6** Freeze final source, complete gates and independent review, align both repositories and synchronize GitHub."

msgid "先完成 B1，B3 与 B6 可并行，再接 B2；B4 在 Provider 合同稳定后实施，B5 与 B7 在 装配入口稳定后实施，最后完成 B8 和 B9。测试随功能增量执行，完整交付绑定最终冻结 源码，不在每个内部重排步骤重复整个平台矩阵。"
msgstr "Complete B1 first, then B3 and B6 in parallel, followed by B2. B4 follows the stable Provider contract; B5 and B7 follow the stable assembly entry point. Finish B8 and B9 afterward. Tests accompany functional increments, and complete delivery binds the final frozen source rather than replaying the whole platform matrix after every internal rearrangement."

msgid "验收看新增 MCU 的公共修改面、应用要理解的内部内容、实际编译与链接范围，以及热 构建是否执行额外工作。既有组件加载曾测为 14–17 毫秒，保留显式加载；历史计时不能 证明新源码性能。时间结论必须说明样本、工具链、并行预算和实际范围。"
msgstr "Acceptance examines common changes needed for MCU onboarding, internal details applications must understand, actual compilation/link scope and unnecessary work in warm builds. Earlier component loading measured 14–17 ms, so explicit loading remains. Historical timings do not establish new-source performance. Timing claims state samples, toolchain, parallel budget and actual scope."

msgid "参考边界"
msgstr "Reference boundaries"

msgid "[Zephyr 构建阶段](https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/build/cmake/index.html)区分配置和执行， [ESP-IDF 组件依赖](https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/stable/esp32/api-guides/build-system.html#component-requirements) 区分公开与私有要求，[CMake 3.31 目标模型](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.31/manual/cmake-buildsystem.7.html) 提供依赖传播。Nexus 使用这些边界，保留 TOML、静态 factory 和唯一生产图；产品任务、 应用策略与物理验收不属于本轮构建重构。"
msgstr "[Zephyr build phases](https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/build/cmake/index.html) distinguish configuration from execution. [ESP-IDF component requirements](https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/stable/esp32/api-guides/build-system.html#component-requirements) distinguish public and private requirements, and the [CMake 3.31 target model](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.31/manual/cmake-buildsystem.7.html) provides dependency propagation. Nexus applies these boundaries while retaining TOML, static factories and one production graph. Product tasks, application policy and physical acceptance are outside this build refactor."

msgid "`nexus_add_runtime()` 只创建可复用库。应用拥有 startup、链接脚本和最终 executable； MCU 自建 executable 必须显式调用 `nexus_apply_firmware_policy(target)`，再链接 `Nexus::Runtime`。单独链接 Runtime 不自动选择运行库或 `-nostartfiles`。"
msgstr "`nexus_add_runtime()` creates reusable libraries only. Applications own startup, the linker script and the final executable. An application-created MCU executable must explicitly call `nexus_apply_firmware_policy(target)` and link `Nexus::Runtime`. Linking Runtime alone does not automatically select runtime libraries or `-nostartfiles`."
